From 0b93d873ee0428b7b2d9f09be23ecf0712b7be9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rasheed <arasheedu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:32:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] trace: deep detail level for llama-server graph nodes
 and logit lens

Deep (> Full) forwards decode.node, decode.lens and decode.attn.heads and
asks llama-server for detail "full" with deep: true. X-Trace-Detail: deep
and OLLAMA_TRACE_DETAIL=deep select it; everything allowed at Full is
allowed at Deep, and the new events get the same 0-based step as the rest.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
